#8100
Entrance to the Wastelands~
   Before you stretches a wasteland, with a bleak gray mist hanging
heavily in the air.  Posts dot the landscape, each with a body impaled
upon its shaft, and crows pick at the remains.  The sky has suddenly
grown unnaturally dark, as if some unseen, powerful force had eclipsed
the sun.  A passage leads back northeast, and the wasteland stretches
away to the southwest.
~
